  "pointsSystem": "Standard CrossFit Games points-per-place scale, max 100 for 1st in every event. Points descend with place on a table whose per-place increment depends on the field size for a given event: full-field Thursday/Friday/Saturday-morning events (~40, then ~32 after early withdrawals) step down by 3 per place from 100 (100, 97, 94, 91...), while the Sunday events contested by the top 30 use a compressed table stepping down by ~4 per place (100, 96, 92, 88...). Two events were scored on combined sub-event placement (2024-04 Track and Field, two separately timed parts) or elimination round-then-time (2024-06 Clean Ladder) rather than a single time. All place and points values are taken directly from the official CrossFit Games leaderboard archive (c3po API).",
